close_reason: "Implemented bounded annotation mutation receipts with explicit full-history restoration across CLI, SDK, MCP, schemas, completion, and docs; exact-head 100% coverage and all release gates pass."
body: "Desired contract: mutation commands emit an idempotent bounded receipt with item id, appended annotation identity or index, author, timestamp, changed count, omission metadata, and an explicit opt-in to restore history. Apply the same response shape to comments, notes, and learnings through shared SDK primitives. Preserve stored history exactly; change only the default mutation projection. Add a realistic long-lived fixture so token-budget gates measure the write path."
